              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "isInner": false,
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"lh-service-grid\">\n<article class=\"lh-service-card\"><span class=\"lh-service-number\">01</span><div><h3 class=\"lh-service-title\">3D Modeling & Scene Design</h3><p class=\"lh-service-copy\">Product-centric 3D scenes and stylized campaign worlds.</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"lh-service-card\"><span class=\"lh-service-number\">02</span><div><h3 class=\"lh-service-title\">Generative Art Direction</h3><p class=\"lh-service-copy\">AI image workflows refined into premium, brand-safe visual directions.</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"lh-service-card\"><span class=\"lh-service-number\">03</span><div><h3 class=\"lh-service-title\">VFX & Compositing</h3><p class=\"lh-service-copy\">Cinematic polish, retouching and post-production integration.</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"lh-service-card\"><span class=\"lh-service-number\">04</span><div><h3 class=\"lh-service-title\">Campaign Key Visuals</h3><p class=\"lh-service-copy\">Hero images, visual systems and adaptations for brand campaigns.</p></div></article>\n</div>"
